  "prefLabel": "Diet 403.06 Activation of a License That Lapsed for More Than One Year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Diet 403.06 Activation of a License That Lapsed for More Than One Year. A licensee who wishes to reactivate a license lapsed for more than one year shall apply for an initial license complying with Diet 302 and provide documentation of completion of a minimum of 20 hours of continuing education in accordance with Diet 405 within the immediately preceding 2 years.\n\nSource. #14314, eff 9-9-25, EXPIRES: 9-9-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/diet100-500.html"
